          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "விம்மு (vimmu) is native Dravidian (DEDR 5402). DEDR keeps a second விம்மு, \"to swell\", apart as its own entry (5397)."
            }
